    "topic_pdf_docs_example_body": "Merge the twelve pages, fix rotation, then compress once and preview at 100%. Compressing each file first makes you guess the combined size. Word-to-word diffs are Text compare, not this hub. Images-to-PDF starts under Image & media.",
