    "topic_design_brand_example_title": "#1a73e8 on white",
    "topic_design_brand_example_body": "Run the pair at body size and large-text thresholds. AA passing is not AAA. Dark mode needs separate surface/text values, not the same hex inverted blindly. Extracting colors from a photo is Image & media, then lock tokens here.",
    "topic_design_brand_boundary": "Open Graph preview and color-from-image list secondarily. User testing still required.",
